            <li><span itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem"><span itemprop="name">  Capacity Building Support for the Indonesia Coast Guard Agency (BAKAMLA) （Overview）</span><meta itemprop="position" content="3" /></span></li>
            </ul>
          </nav>
          <!-- //breadcrumbs -->

          <section class="topics topics-article">
            <!-- 記事タイトル -->
            <h1 class="entry-title"> Capacity Building Support for the Indonesia Coast Guard Agency (BAKAMLA) （Overview）</h1>
            <!-- 記事投稿時間 -->
            <aside class="topics-article__time">
              <time datetime="2021-3-1">29 September, 2026</time>
            </aside>
            <div class="topics-article__main tich-text">
            <p>The MCT provided capacity-building support to BAKAMLA personnel for<br />matters necessary for maritime law enforcement activities through the<br />JICA framework.<br />During this mission, practical training was conducted on criminal<br />investigation procedures related to oil discharge incidents, with a<br />focus on initial response at the scene.<br />Guidance was also provided on how to prepare documents incorporating<br />photographs, sketches, and other findings from the practical exercise.<br />Participants presented the documents they had prepared, thereby<br />reviewing a series of procedures required for criminal investigations.<br />We will continue to respond with precise care to their requests<br />regarding our support through consultations. While strengthening our<br />relationships of trust, MCT will effectively implement capacitybuilding<br />support by maintaining consistency and continuity.<br />The JCG will strengthen cooperation and collaboration with the coast<br />guard agencies of other countries to realize a Free and Open Indo-<br />Pacific (FOIP), while supporting capacity-building efforts for<br />countries in the Indo-Pacific region.<br /><br /><a href="upload/2609Indonesia_En.pdf">Capacity Building Support for the Indonesia Coast Guard Agency (BAKAMLA) （Overview）（PDF:269 KB）<br /><br /></a></p>
<table style="width: 586px; max-width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse;" border="0" align="center">
